          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghana ghwanyas guroorooda beelda, siida was ng'eedeeda, ak ghabeala gatmoadaanyi; abeeda gayghwayiin gatmooni madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gaygwasin ashoohoocheanda aba badaydaanyi deaweedajeesu seaniin. ",
          "type": "text",
